WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.325
To pick at random, pick a place, then take the item at that place.

2
00:00:05.101 --> 00:00:09.951
pick random zero to two gives zero, one or two. Different each time.

3
00:00:12.442 --> 00:00:17.492
length of list counts the items. The last place is the length minus one.

4
00:00:18.598 --> 00:00:23.398
So picking from zero to the length minus one reaches every item.
